{% set PASS = "✔" %}
{% set FAIL = "❌" %}
{% set WARN = "⚠" %}

============================================================
🔍 AAP 2.6 Containerized Growth Precheck Report
============================================================

System Summary:
------------------------------------------------------------
Host:        {{ inventory_hostname }}
User:        {{ ansible_user_id }}
OS:          {{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }}
------------------------------------------------------------

Results:
------------------------------------------------------------
{% for r in precheck_results %}
{{ (PASS if r.status == "PASS" else FAIL if r.status == "FAIL" else WARN) }} {{ "%-24s"|format(r.requirement) }} : {{ r.observed }}
{% if r.status != "PASS" %}
  → Remediation:
{% if r.requirement == "Execution user" %}
    Run playbook as a non-root user created for AAP installation.
{% elif r.requirement == "Privilege escalation" %}
    Ensure user has passwordless sudo (edit /etc/sudoers).
{% elif r.requirement == "Operating system" %}
    Upgrade to supported RHEL version (>= {{ min_rhel_version }}).
{% elif r.requirement == "CPU" %}
    Increase vCPU count to at least {{ min_cpu }}.
{% elif r.requirement == "Memory" %}
    Increase memory to at least 16GB (32GB recommended for seeding).
{% elif r.requirement == "Total disk" %}
    Increase disk to >= 60GB AND expand OS filesystem:
      sudo growpart /dev/xvda 3
      sudo xfs_growfs /
{% elif r.requirement is search("Install dir") %}
    Ensure home filesystem (~/) has >= 15GB free space.
{% elif r.requirement == "Podman" %}
    Install podman: sudo dnf install -y podman
{% elif r.requirement == "ansible-core" %}
    Install ansible-core: sudo dnf install -y ansible-core
{% elif r.requirement == "Hostname FQDN" %}
    Configure a fully qualified hostname:
      sudo hostnamectl set-hostname server.example.com
      Ensure /etc/hosts contains the FQDN entry.
{% elif r.requirement == "AAP Setup Bundle" %}
  Download the AAP Containerized Setup Bundle from Red Hat Customer Portal.
  Place the file in the project files/ directory:
      {{ playbook_dir }}/files
  Filename must contain:
      setup bundle
      .tar.gz
  File size must be larger than 3GB.
{% else %}
    Review system configuration to meet requirement.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
------------------------------------------------------------
Summary:
✔ PASS: {{ precheck_results | selectattr('status','equalto','PASS') | list | length }}
❌ FAIL: {{ precheck_results | selectattr('status','equalto','FAIL') | list | length }}
⚠ WARN: {{ precheck_results | selectattr('status','equalto','WARN') | list | length }}
============================================================

{% if (precheck_results | selectattr('status','equalto','FAIL') | list | length) > 0 %}
❌ SYSTEM NOT READY FOR INSTALL

Recommended next steps:
1. Address all FAIL items above
2. Re-run this precheck
3. Proceed with AAP installer once all checks PASS
{% else %}
✅ SYSTEM READY FOR AAP INSTALLATION
{% endif %}